9️⃣ Scenario: Large message size

Question

Kafka performance is slow because messages are very large (10MB+). What should you do?

Answer

Best practice:

Store file/data in external storage:

object storage

database

file system

Kafka message contains only reference link.

Example:

Kafka message:
{
  file_url: "storage/payment_receipt_123.pdf"
}
🔟 Scenario: Reprocessing old data

Question

Your analytics team wants to reprocess messages from the last 7 days. How can Kafka support this?

Answer

Kafka stores messages based on retention policy.

Example:

retention.ms = 7 days

Consumers can reset offset:

consumer.seek()

Or create a new consumer group to read from beginning.

